  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/459fad44-da37-49a6-99e9-83085f49c48d\" alt=\"cflogobanner\"></p><h3><strong>關於：</strong></h3><p>Create: Food 是基於擴展 Minecraft 食物內容的附加模組。</p><p>這些模組並非必要，但不可或缺。缺少它們，許多物品將無法合成。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></li>\n</ul><p>這些模組非必要，但推薦安裝。缺少它們，會出現明顯的內容缺口。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-creators-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Creators</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/display-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Display Delight</a></li>\n</ul><p>關於與 Create 和 Farmer's Delight 附加模組的相容性資訊，請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><h3><strong>當前內容：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>超過 1000 種食物相關物品和超過 100 種新流體。物品列表請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Item-list\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</li>\n<li>所有內容均可高度配置，包括隱藏物品、修改營養/飽和度數值，以及添加自訂物品、方塊、流體和展示盤。更多資訊請閱讀<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Config-Options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</li>\n<li>完整實作了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flets-do.ch%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's Do 系列</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kaleidoscope-cookery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaleidoscope Cookery</a> 等的效果。</li>\n<li>簡易配方的雙手合成系統。更多資訊請閱讀<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Handcrafting-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</li>\n<li>任何物品都可以擺放在盤子上。你也可以直接從盤子進食，或將盤子當作砧板使用。指南請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Display-Blocks-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</li>\n<li>布料過濾器可手動使用或用於配方中。更多資訊請閱讀<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Cloth-Filters-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</li>\n<li>兩種儲物方塊：布料袋和口糧箱。更多資訊請閱讀<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Storage-Blocks-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</li>\n<li>披薩、蛋糕、派（包括南瓜派）等可放置方塊。</li>\n<li>熱飲的動態紋理。</li>\n</ul><p>關於 2.0.0 之前版本的資訊，請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><h3><strong>物品預覽 (2.5.0)</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a20d646f-981a-4eaa-8755-852639e6cd96\" alt=\"fullprev250\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/993237fc-c7c8-4325-a47b-9e9401f5b213\" alt=\"bucketprev240\"></p><h3><strong>我的其他模組</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-engineers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Engineers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-metalwork-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Metalwork</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-chefs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Chefs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rune Essence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stack-size-edit-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stack Size Edit</a></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>致謝：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>紋理基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 中的資源。</li>\n</ul>",
